# QA Q1 (fixed in T20b): every Track select option is reachable by keyboard/gamepad. Focusing a
# card previews it; Confirm selects it and puts the focus on Choose car; Up reaches every option;
# Back returns to the card. Configures Toy Town: Reverse, 1 lap, next weather and time (run with
# --unlock-all so Reverse is unlocked).
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit (previewed)
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # Toy Town
0.8 shot tsr_01_toy_town_focused
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select it: the focus moves to Choose car
0.8 shot tsr_02_choose_car_focused
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Time of day
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # next time
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Weather
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # next weather
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Items
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # AI difficulty
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Rivals
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Laps (Toy Town: 4)
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # 3
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # 2
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # 1
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Mirror
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Layout
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Reverse
0.8 shot tsr_03_toy_town_configured
0.3 nav keyboardA back             # back on the Toy Town card, options kept
0.8 shot tsr_04_back_on_the_card
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Choose car again
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.8 shot tsr_05_car_select
1.0 exit
